  "canon": "Chapter16 Ruan Xiaowu is one of seven shirtless jujube merchants who cover eleven tribute burdens in seven Jiangzhou carts and push away. Chapter15 strong hands/big eyes, slanted broken headcloth, pomegranate flower and ONE blue leopard FRONT chest retained; back clean. Flower on anatomical RIGHT visible SE/NE only, navy headcloth, face/short beard, tan gathered trousers, grey sash/tails, light wraps/dark shoes, cart construction/covered loads/rope/wheel and weapon stowage are established art interpretations. No other brother identity or magic/plot added. Rear support-leg alternation, PA/B similarity, full wheel/cloth continuity, Ruan Xiaoqi, three-target/shoulder wording and seven-cart-eleven-burden mapping remain open. Only ruan_xiaowu/hn_ruan_xiaowu carrying_tribute in level1."
